<row>
<entry align="left" valign="top"><simpara><link xl:href="https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/blob/master/spring-boot-project/spring-boot-actuator/src/main/java/org/springframework/boot/actuate/influx/InfluxDbHealthIndicator.java"><literal>InfluxDbHealthIndicator</literal>(https://goo.gl/ZPx5os)</link></simpara></entry>
<entry align="left" valign="top"><simpara>InfluxDB 작동을 확인가능하다.</simpara></entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry align="left" valign="top"><simpara><link xl:href="https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/blob/master/spring-boot-project/spring-boot-actuator/src/main/java/org/springframework/boot/actuate/jms/JmsHealthIndicator.java"><literal>JmsHealthIndicator</literal>(https://goo.gl/mpc38p)</link></simpara></entry>
<entry align="left" valign="top"><simpara>JMS 브로커 작동을 확인가능하다.</simpara></entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry align="left" valign="top"><simpara><link xl:href="https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/blob/master/spring-boot-project/spring-boot-actuator/src/main/java/org/springframework/boot/actuate/mail/MailHealthIndicator.java"><literal>MailHealthIndicator</literal>(https://goo.gl/VZLJbR)</link></simpara></entry>
<entry align="left" valign="top"><simpara>메일서버 작동을 확인가능하다.</simpara></entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry align="left" valign="top"><simpara><link xl:href="https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/blob/master/spring-boot-project/spring-boot-actuator/src/main/java/org/springframework/boot/actuate/mongo/MongoHealthIndicator.java"><literal>MongoHealthIndicator</literal>(https://goo.gl/qGHYGw)</link></simpara></entry>
<entry align="left" valign="top"><simpara>몽고데이터베이스 작동을 확인가능하다.</simpara></entry>
