<entry align="left" valign="top"><simpara>Neo4j 서버 작동을 확인한다.</simpara></entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry align="left" valign="top"><simpara><link xl:href="https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/blob/master/spring-boot-project/spring-boot-actuator/src/main/java/org/springframework/boot/actuate/amqp/RabbitHealthIndicator.java"><literal>RabbitHealthIndicator</literal>(https://goo.gl/W77m5u)</link></simpara></entry>
<entry align="left" valign="top"><simpara>래빗서버의 작동을 확인가능하다.</simpara></entry>
