<row>
<entry align="left" valign="top"><simpara><link xl:href="https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/blob/master/spring-boot-project/spring-boot-actuator/src/main/java/org/springframework/boot/actuate/redis/RedisHealthIndicator.java"><literal>RedisHealthIndicator</literal>(https://goo.gl/4ibbGN)</link></simpara></entry>
<entry align="left" valign="top"><simpara>레디스서버의 작동을 확인가능하다.</simpara></entry>
</row>
